<div id="m-0b75ba14-bb40-8f3b-b898-0ad84bbd7d50" data-section-uuid="0b75ba14-bb40-8f3b-b898-0ad84bbd7d50" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">Human</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T08:30:00+00:00" title="2369-04-15 08:30:00 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 08:30</time>

What's wrong with this medical-tricorder readout?

🖼 *[tricorder-readout.png (not yet fetched)]*

</div>

<div id="m-0b75ba15-6b08-8cc3-b955-0a31599f6495" data-section-uuid="0b75ba15-6b08-8cc3-b955-0a31599f6495" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">claude-opus-4-7</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T08:30:45+00:00" title="2369-04-15 08:30:45 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 08:30</time>

The readout shows elevated isoboramine (62 ng/mL; reference 35–40) and depressed serotonin uptake. Consistent with early-stage Vulcan neuro-pressure deficit. Recommend mind-meld therapy at 24h intervals.

</div>
